.credentials

# Uploaded media and signed contracts must never be committed. Contracts in
# particular contain personal data + signatures; they belong in Cloudinary /
# object storage, not in version control.
backend/uploads/
backend/private_contracts/

# ...but DO track the env templates (no secrets in them) — the new host needs
# them as the canonical list of variables to configure.
!.env.example
!backend/.env.example
!frontend/.env.example
.claude/
screenshots/

# Throwaway verification scripts. Written to drive a browser or probe the
# dev database while checking a change, then deleted. Ignored rather than
# committed so a stray one cannot be mistaken for tooling — the real
# checkers (screenshot.mjs, check-tile-contrast.mjs) have proper names.
scripts/.tmp-*
